create_canvas_node.description:
Create a new node on the canvas. Returns the created node with its generated ID.

PAYLOAD: { environmentId (auto), node: { type, category, position: {x, y}, data: { label, config? }, measured?: {width, height}, groupId?: string|null, sortIndex?: number } }

TYPE-TO-CATEGORY MAPPING (category is required and must match the type):
- trigger: chatInput, webhook, schedule
- ai: llmCall, agent, planner, orchestrator, agentTeam
- tools: webSearch, databaseQuery, fileSearch, apiCall, runCode
- condition: condition (NOTE: category is 'condition', NOT 'logic')
- logic: memory, humanInTheLoop, parser
- output: chatOutput, fileOutput, objectOutput

CONNECTION RULES (for planning edge creation after node creation):
- trigger -> ai only
- ai -> ai, condition, logic, output
- tools -> input-only (connect TO ai nodes as tools, cannot be an edge source)
- condition -> anything except trigger (has true/false output paths)
- memory -> input-only (connect TO ai nodes)
- parser, humanInTheLoop -> anything except trigger
- output -> terminal (cannot connect further)

